menu "chargelatch meter telemetry"

    config METER_TELEMETRY_INTERVAL_SECONDS
        int "Read and publish interval (seconds)"
        default 5
        range 2 3600
        help
            How often the meter is read and published to devices/<id>/meter. A full SDM120 read
            takes about 1 s at 2400 baud, so going below 2 s is pointless.

endmenu
